# Root build context: docker-image-build.yml and fly.toml both build with
# context `.` and -f backend/Dockerfile, so THIS file is the only .dockerignore
# Docker consults (a backend/.dockerignore would be ignored).
# Keep the context lean and never ship host artifacts into images.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
.git
.github
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.claude
